switch Statements

->A switch statement is used to check one variable against multiple 
possible values. It is often a cleaner alternative to writing many 
if...else if statements.

Keywords
switch → Starts the switch statement.
case → Checks if the value matches.
break → Stops the switch after a match is found.
default → Runs if no case matches.

Syntex:-
   switch (expression) 
{
    case value1:
        // Code to execute if expression === value1
        break;

    case value2:
        // Code to execute if expression === value2
        break;

    default:
        // Code to execute if no case matches
}//close of switch